# Everything in this repo deploys to Linux devices (Kindle/Kobo). Force LF
# on checkout regardless of local git autocrlf settings - a CRLF shebang
# line (`#!/bin/sh\r`) makes a script fail to exec with a misleading
# "not found" error, which cost a long debugging session on 2026-08-27
# after a Windows checkout silently reintroduced CRLF into a locally-edited
# script that then got deployed as-is.
* text=auto eol=lf
